            "sid": "JER 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siku hiyo itakapofika, nasema mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, nitaivunja nira iliyo shingoni mwao na kukata minyororo yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao hawatakuwa tena watumwa wa wageni, bali watanitumikia mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wao, na mfalme wa ukoo wa Daudi ambaye nitawateulia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
